iv><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 0; width:46.5116%; background-color:#ffffff; left:46.5116%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 6.9767%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Formorgar%20Mines\">Formorgar Mines</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32268,31090,14\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32268, 31090, 14)</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tA melting frozen horror attacks in melee range.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tFor this fight you will need a knight level 150+, a paladin level 120+, a druid level 130+ and two sorcerers 160+. Whence coming inside the boss room you will notice two <a href=\"#/wiki/Icicle%20%28Creature%29\">Icicles</a> and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Egg\">Dragon Egg</a> between them. Shot <a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Wall\">Magic Walls</a> in front of these pillars, let the sorcerers use their strongest fire attacks on the Dragon Egg to get it to full HP. When reaching full HP, you can start SD'ing the boss. Keep the boss away from the egg, and keep the <a href=\"#/wiki/Frozen%20Minion\">Frozen Minions</a> away from the boss, as their attacks as well as all <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Damage\">Ice Damage</a> heals it. \n</p><p>Continue with this strategy untill the boss is dead.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 82 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Col